## 🗃️ Data Sources

### Source Tables
- **AVARUMCashSalesCashVoucher** - Cash voucher header
- **SalesLine** - Sales line items (filtered by AVARUMCashVoucher)
- **InventTable** - Item master
- **EcoResProduct** - Product master
- **EcoResProductTranslation** - Localized product names
- **CompanyInfo** - Company data
- **LogisticsPostalAddress** - Address data
- **LogisticsElectronicAddress** - Phone data

### Temporary Tables
- **AVARUMCashInvoiceTmpHeader** - Report header dataset
- **AVARUMCashInvoiceTmpLines** - Report lines dataset

