## 🔧 Common Customizations

### Add a Field to Header

**Step 1**: Add to temp table
```xml
<!-- In AVARUMCashInvoiceTmpHeader.xml -->
<AxTableField xmlns="" i:type="AxTableFieldString">
    <Name>CustomField</Name>
    <ExtendedDataType>YourEDT</ExtendedDataType>
</AxTableField>
```

**Step 2**: Populate in DP
```xpp
// In AVARUMCashInvoiceDP.populateHeaderData()
tmpHeader.CustomField = cashSalesVoucher.CustomField;
```

**Step 3**: Add to report dataset
```xml
<!-- In AVARUMCashInvoice.xml -->
<AxReportDataSetField>
    <Name>CustomField</Name>
    <Alias>AVARUMCashInvoiceTmpHeader.CustomField</Alias>
    <Caption>@YourLabel</Caption>
</AxReportDataSetField>
```

**Step 4**: Add to RDL design
- Open RDL in Visual Studio
- Add textbox bound to =Fields!CustomField.Value

### Filter Lines by Criteria

```xpp
// In AVARUMCashInvoiceDP.populateLinesData()
while select salesLine
    where salesLine.AVARUMCashVoucher == cashVoucher
       && salesLine.ItemId != ''  // Add your filter
       && salesLine.SalesQty > 0  // Add your filter
    // ... rest of query
```

