## 🐛 Quick Troubleshooting

| Issue | Solution |
|-------|----------|
| Report not in menu | Check menu item deployment |
| Lookup empty | Verify AVARUMCashSalesCashVoucher has data |
| No lines shown | Check SalesLine.AVARUMCashVoucher is populated |
| Company info blank | Verify CompanyInfo and addresses exist |
| Build errors | Check all EDT references exist |

