## 📞 Developer Notes

- **Language**: Report supports localized product names via EcoResProductTranslation
- **Currency**: Uses system currency for amounts
- **Format**: Decimal formatting uses N2 (2 decimal places)
- **Date**: Print date uses short date format
- **Session**: Temp tables scoped to report session

